  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_ricochet.name": "Ricochet",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_ricochet.desc": "Throw the shield at the target in your sights: it ricochets between up to 5 enemies (8 with 50+ kinetic charge, spends 50) for 9 damage, -15% per bounce, and flies back to you. Hold to aim a bank shot off walls (up to 4 bounces). Press again in flight to recall it, hitting enemies on the way. Catch it during a combo for a Return Strike.",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_shield_rush.name": "Shield Rush",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_shield_rush.desc": "Charge up to 9 blocks behind the shield: enemies on the path take 6 and are swept aside; the first big enemy or a wall stops you with a 10-damage bash and a 1.25 s stun. Your next attack continues the combo from the uppercut. Without the shield: a shoulder charge for 8.",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_vibranium_slam.name": "Vibranium Slam",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_vibranium_slam.desc": "Leap up and forward and drive the shield into the ground: a radius-4 wave for 10 damage that launches enemies. With 50+ kinetic charge (spends 50): radius 6, 14 damage and a white-blue star flash. Needs the shield in hand.",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_tactical_roll.name": "Tactical Roll",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_tactical_roll.desc": "Roll 4.5 blocks the way you move (or back), untouchable for a moment. Attack right after for a sweeping kick. Rolling toward the flying shield catches it sooner.",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_assemble.name": "Avengers, Assemble!",
  "ability.viltrumitecore.captain_assemble.desc": "Ultimate. Raise the shield and call the team: the Quinjet drops Black Widow and Hawkeye, Iron Man lands from the sky, Thor arrives in lightning and the Hulk leaps in. The six of you stand in a circle, then the Avengers fight at your side for 60 seconds and pull off joint moves: Widow vaults Hawkeye into the air, Thor overcharges Iron Man's unibeam, and Thor strikes your raised shield for a shockwave. Cooldown 5 minutes.",
